        "path": "singularity/work-items/9-hex/artifacts/specification/spec.md"
      },
      "type": "REQ"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "[9-hex:REQ-003]",
      "body": "The operator shall display the literal `ERR` when the input is empty, syntactically invalid, or outside the accepted range. *(S2)*",
      "bodySha256": "45a506605dc14e3004e0f5ec786d027cd304723ed45f5fc4a5c8554a3bf8284c",
      "dependsOn": [],
      "id": "9-HEX:REQ-003",
