      "type": "REQ"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "[9-hex:AC-001]",
      "body": "Applying the operator to `0`, `255`, and `9007199254740991` displays `0`, `FF`, and `1FFFFFFFFFFFFF`, respectively. *(S1)*",
