      },
      "type": "AC"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "[9-hex:AC-002]",
      "body": "Applying the operator to empty input, `-1`, `+1`, `1.5`, whitespace-containing text, alphabetic text, or a leading-zero value such as `01` displays exactly `ERR`. *(S2)*",
